    content: "---\nname: Obsidian Kinetic\ncolors:\n  surface: \'#10131b\'\n  surface-dim: \'#10131b\'\n  surface-bright: \'#363941\'\n  surface-container-lowest: \'#0b0e15\'\n  surface-container-low: \'#181b23\'\n  surface-container: \'#1d2027\'\n  surface-container-high: \'#272a32\'\n  surface-container-highest: \'#32353d\'\n  on-surface: \'#e0e2ed\'\n  on-surface-variant: \'#c1cab5\'\n  inverse-surface: \'#e0e2ed\'\n  inverse-on-surface: \'#2d3038\'\n  outline: \'#8b9481\'\n  outline-variant: \'#41493a\'\n  surface-tint: \'#91d963\'\n  primary: \'#d0ffad\'\n  on-primary: \'#153800\'\n  primary-container: \'#9fe870\'\n  on-primary-container: \'#2e6900\'\n  inverse-primary: \'#2f6c00\'\n  secondary: \'#68d9c8\'\n  on-secondary: \'#003731\'\n  secondary-container: \'#23a292\'\n  on-secondary-container: \'#00302a\'\n  tertiary: \'#ffeee1\'\n  on-tertiary: \'#492900\'\n  tertiary-container: \'#ffcb97\'\n  on-tertiary-container: \'#845009\'\n  error: \'#ffb4ab\'\n  on-error: \'#690005\'\n  error-container: \'#93000a\'\n  on-error-container: \'#ffdad6\'\n  primary-fixed: \'#acf67c\'\n  primary-fixed-dim: \'#91d963\'\n  on-primary-fixed: \'#092100\'\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: \'#225100\'\n  secondary-fixed: \'#86f6e4\'\n  secondary-fixed-dim: \'#68d9c8\'\n  on-secondary-fixed: \'#00201c\'\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: \'#005048\'\n  tertiary-fixed: \'#ffdcbc\'\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: \'#ffb86c\'\n  on-tertiary-fixed: \'#2c1600\'\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: \'#683c00\'\n  background: \'#10131b\'\n  on-background: \'#e0e2ed\'\n  surface-variant: \'#32353d\'\ntypography:\n  display-xl:\n    fontFamily: Space Grotesk\n    fontSize: 72px\n    fontWeight: \'700\'\n    lineHeight: 76px\n    letterSpacing: -0.04em\n  display-xl-mobile:\n    fontFamily: Space Grotesk\n    fontSize: 40px\n    fontWeight: \'700\'\n    lineHeight: 44px\n    letterSpacing: -0.03em\n  headline-lg:\n    fontFamily: Space Grotesk\n    fontSize: 48px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 54px\n    letterSpacing: -0.03em\n  headline-lg-mobile:\n    fontFamily: Space Grotesk\n    fontSize: 32px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 38px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\n  headline-md:\n    fontFamily: Space Grotesk\n    fontSize: 32px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 40px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\n  headline-sm:\n    fontFamily: Space Grotesk\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: \'500\'\n    lineHeight: 32px\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\n  body-lg:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 18px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 15px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n  body-sm:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 13px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n  code-lg:\n    fontFamily: JetBrains Mono\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: \'500\'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n  code-md:\n    fontFamily: JetBrains Mono\n    fontSize: 13px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n  code-sm:\n    fontFamily: JetBrains Mono\n    fontSize: 11px\n    fontWeight: \'500\'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.06em\n  label-caps:\n    fontFamily: JetBrains Mono\n    fontSize: 11px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 14px\n    letterSpacing: 0.12em\nrounded:\n  sm: 0.125rem\n  DEFAULT: 0.25rem\n  md: 0.375rem\n  lg: 0.5rem\n  xl: 0.75rem\n  full: 9999px\nspacing:\n  gutter: 1.5rem\n  gutter-sm: 1rem\n  margin: 2rem\n  margin-sm: 1rem\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\n  space-md: 1rem\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\n  space-xl: 2.5rem\n---\n\n## Brand & Style\n\nThis design system channels an avant-garde editorial atmosphere fused with the precision of a high-performance developer cockpit. Tailored specifically for showcasing mobile architecture, high-frequency React Native engineering, and creative code, the aesthetic reflects ruthless technical competence alongside bespoke editorial restraint.\n\nThe visual direction combines Dark Minimalist Editorial and Technical Glassmorphism:\n- **Atmosphere:** Deep void spaces, architectural rhythm, and surgical grid-lines evoking late-night compiler sessions and high-end typography publications.\n- **Audience:** Engineering leads, product founders, design-forward tech companies, and tier-one recruiters demanding uncompromising design execution and robust mobile systems architecture.\n- **Emotional Intent:** Imparts instantaneous authority, intellectual rigor, hyper-competence, and kinetic energy through neon-charged accents against deep obsidian grounds.\n\n## Colors\n\nThe palette operates on high-contrast nocturnal values where bright bioluminescent accents punch through deep layered voids.\n\n- **Primary Canvas (Dark Void - `#080B12`):** Ground-level substrate across the entire viewport.\n- **Elevated Surfaces:** \n  - `Secondary Surface (#111827)`: Modular card panels, dashboards, and code container backgrounds.\n  - `Tertiary Surface (#1A2234)`: Flyouts, terminal headers, elevated pill badges, and active toggle backgrounds.\n- **Structural Lines (`#273244`):** Micro-borders, precision crosshairs, and Cartesian background grids calibrated to provide subtle structure without visual weight.\n- **Accent Kinetics:**\n  - `Lime Neon (#9FE870)`: Main interactive affordances, core CTA elements, status badges for production readiness, and active tab indicators.\n  - `Cyan Neon (#65D6C5)`: Metric callouts, architecture flow lines, secondary interactive states, and mobile viewport wireframe accents.\n  - `Code Amber (#FFB86C)`: Syntax tokens, warning triggers, benchmark tags, and build-time metrics.\n  - `Error Crimson (#FF5555)`: Fault states, telemetry error simulations, and critical test suite badges.\n- **Content Hierarchy:**\n  - `Primary Text (#F5F7FA)`: Headings, vital code lines, and active values.\n  - `Secondary Text (#A1AAB8)`: Body descriptions, metadata timestamps, and architectural documentation.\n\n## Typography\n\nThe type system balances technical rigor with editorial scale:\n\n- **Display & Headings (Space Grotesk):** Tight tracking, high geometric posture, and distinctive ink-traps. Used to deliver striking statements, project titles, and section anchors.\n- **Narrative & Body (Inter):** Highly legible neutral grotesque used for case studies, bio summaries, and deep technical writing.\n- **Telemetry, Badges & Code (JetBrains Mono):** Monospaced precision for technical metadata, benchmark counters, React Native performance metrics (60 FPS, JSI bridges), command line arguments, and terminal labels.\n- Set uppercase labels (`label-caps`) with explicit tracking (`letterSpacing: 0.12em`) to echo mechanical schematic readouts.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\n\nThe foundation is built on an architectural 12-column responsive fluid grid complemented by an optional background sub-grid (24px by 24px) rendered with `#273244` at 30% opacity.\n\n- **Desktop (>= 1200px):** 12 columns, `1.5rem` (24px) gutters, `2rem` (32px) screen edge margins. Max content container is capped at 1440px to retain editorial tension.\n- **Tablet (768px - 1199px):** 8 columns, `1.25rem` gutters, `1.5rem` margins.\n- **Mobile (< 768px):** 4 columns, `1rem` (16px) gutters, `1rem` (16px) margins. Dynamic reflow translates multi-column architecture graphs into vertical stack traces.\n- Spacing cadence adheres strictly to the 4px/8px mathematical scale to align monospace code lines seamlessly with surrounding components.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\nVisual hierarchy uses luminous depth instead of classical drop shadows:\n\n- **Substrate (Level 0):** `#080B12` base canvas with 1px structural grid lines.\n- **Glass Panel (Level 1):** `#111827` rendered at 70% alpha with a `12px` backdrop blur (`backdrop-filter: blur(12px)`) and a `1px` continuous border in `#273244`.\n- **Raised Module / Terminal Floating Window (Level 2):** `#1A2234` rendered at 85% alpha with a `16px` backdrop blur, encircled by a `#273244` border with a subtle top edge highlight in `#65D6C5` at 20% alpha.\n- **Active Glow Elevation (Level 3):** Focused cards, interactive device frames, and primary nodes project an ambient neon bloom: `box-shadow: 0 0 25px -5px rgba(159, 232, 112, 0.18)`.\n- Shadows are never opaque black; they are diffused void tints: `box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)`.\n\n## Shapes\n\nThe shape system adopts a controlled **Soft (Level 1)** curvature to sustain an engineered, instrument-panel aesthetic:\n\n- **Base Radius (0.25rem / 4px):** Used on terminal chips, status badges, tech stack pills, and input controls.\n- **Container Radius (`rounded-lg` - 0.5rem / 8px):** Used on interactive case study cards, code blocks, and dashboard widgets.\n- **Overlay Radius (`rounded-xl` - 0.75rem / 12px):** Reserved for modal overlays, mobile device preview viewports, and floating dock bars.\n- Corner geometry avoids bubble-like curvature, reinforcing a clean, hardware-grade feel.\n\n## Components\n\n### Buttons\n- **Primary Kinetic:** Background `#9FE870`, text `#080B12`, font `JetBrains Mono` 13px weight 600, uppercase. Padding: `10px 20px`. Hover: `box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(159, 232, 112, 0.4)`. Transitions are rapid: `150ms ease-out`.\n- **Secondary Terminal:** Transparent background, border `1px solid #273244`, text `#F5F7FA`. Hover: border transitions to `#65D6C5`, text transitions to `#65D6C5`, background gains `rgba(101, 214, 197, 0.05)`.\n- **Icon Utility:** Square dimension (40px x 40px), surface `#111827`, border `1px solid #273244`, icon `#A1AAB8`. Hover brings icon to `#9FE870`.\n\n### Chips & Terminal Badges\n- **Status Indicators:** Background `#111827`, border `1px solid #273244`, text `#A1AAB8`, font `code-sm`. Prefixed with a live blinking LED indicator (e.g., 6px circle with `#9FE870` pulsing animation for \"Available for Architecture Audits\").\n- **Tech Stack Tokens:** Monospaced micro-chips with faint `#1A2234` backgrounds and subtle borders, displaying parameters such as `Fabric Engine`, `Turbomodules`, and `Skia`.\n\n### Cards & Project Showcases\n- **Editorial Project Card:** Grounded on `#111827` with 70% opacity and `1px` border of `#273244`. Header displays date metadata and terminal category in `label-caps`. Hover triggers a top border accent illumination in `#9FE870`.\n- **Mobile Preview Stage:** A simulated mobile screen frame with an 8px radius, bezel-tinted with `#1A2234`, presenting live embedded micro-interactions or optimized video captures.\n\n### Lists & Activity Logs\n- **Commit / Architecture Log:** Clean horizontal rows partitioned by `1px solid #273244`. Left column carries monospaced timestamps in `#A1AAB8`, middle column holds the feature headline in `Space Grotesk`, right column displays performance gains (e.g., `+58 FPS`, `-32% TTI`) rendered in `#65D6C5`.\n\n### Input Fields & Terminal Console\n- **Interactive Console Input:** Surface `#080B12`, inset `1px solid #273244`, text `#F5F7FA`, caret `#9FE870`. Prefixed with `> adarsh.tech ~ $`. Focused state illuminates the border to `#65D6C5` with a faint `2px` cyan outer aura.\n\n### Code Display Panels\n- **Code Block:** Surface `#080B12`, header bar with Mac-style or terminal window dots (`#FF5555`, `#FFB86C`, `#9FE870` at 6px diameter). Line numbers colored in `#273244`, variable keywords in `#65D6C5`, functions in `#9FE870`, strings in `#FFB86C`."
