  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Exploring Tailwind v4**\n\nI\'m currently looking at defining font families, color tokens, and utilities directly within `src/index.css` for Tailwind v4. I\'m focusing on the font families present within the image, particularly `\'Space Grotesk\'`. I\'m going to determine how to integrate this into the configuration effectively.\n\n\n**Defining Theme Variables**\n\nI\'ve established font families like \'Inter\' and \'JetBrains Mono\' and defined a comprehensive color palette with primary, secondary, and tertiary surfaces alongside neon and error colors. I\'m experimenting with a Cartesian grid background and planning custom scrollbar styling, neon glow utilities, and pulse animations. My focus is now on integrating these design tokens with the `@theme` directive in Tailwind v4 and the `index.css` file.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_10918106291390067966"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@theme {\\n  --font-display: \'Space Grotesk\', sans-serif;\\n  --font-sans: \'Inter\', sans-serif;\\n  --font-mono: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace;\\n\\n  --color-void: #080b12;\\n  --color-surface-secondary: #111827;\\n  --color-surface-tertiary: #1a2234;\\n  --color-line-structural: #273244;\\n  --color-neon-lime: #9fe870;\\n  --color-neon-cyan: #65d6c5;\\n  --color-code-amber: #ffb86c;\\n  --color-error-crimson: #ff5555;\\n  --color-text-primary: #f5f7fa;\\n  --color-text-secondary: #a1aab8;\\n}\\n\\n/* Cartesian Structural Grid */\\n.bg-cartesian-grid {\\n  background-size: 24px 24px;\\n  background-image: \\n    linear-gradient(to right, rgba(39, 50, 68, 0.35) 1px, transparent 1px),\\n    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(39, 50, 68, 0.35) 1px, transparent 1px);\\n}\\n\\n.bg-cartesian-grid-dense {\\n  background-size: 12px 12px;\\n  background-image: \\n    linear-gradient(to right, rgba(39, 50, 68, 0.25) 1px, transparent 1px),\\n    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(39, 50, 68, 0.25) 1px, transparent 1px);\\n}\\n\\n/* Luminous Glow Effects */\\n.glow-lime {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 25px -5px rgba(159, 232, 112, 0.25);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-lime-sm {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px -2px rgba(159, 232, 112, 0.35);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-cyan {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 25px -5px rgba(101, 214, 197, 0.25);\\n}\\n\\n.glow-cyan-sm {\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px -2px rgba(101, 214, 197, 0.35);\\n}\\n\\n/* Subtle glassmorphism */\\n.glass-panel {\\n  background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.75);\\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n  border: 1px solid #273244;\\n}\\n\\n.glass-panel-elevated {\\n  background: rgba(26, 34, 52, 0.85);\\n  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\\n  border: 1px solid #273244;\\n  border-top-color: rgba(101, 214, 197, 0.3);\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom code scrollbar */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 6px;\\n  height: 6px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: #080b12;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: #273244;\\n  border-radius: 3px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: #65d6c5;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Define theme variables, cartesian grid background, luminous glow effects, and glass panels in index.css\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating index.css\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add design tokens and utilities in index.css\"}"
